<title>NIGERIA: TABLE-Nigerian BOC Gases Q3 profits up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Nigerian BOC Gases Q3 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for BOC Gases, formerly known as Industrial Gases to end-June 1997, published on Monday. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1997	 1996</p>
<p> Turnover			346.8	280.6</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    100.5	 73.0</p>
<p> Taxation			 32.1	 23.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	68.4	 49.7</p>
<p>($1=83.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
